  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project to Prevent and Combat Gender Based Violence(GBV) in Egypt(UNFPA)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhanced community awareness of gender-based violence, harmful practices and age appropriate reproductive health.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the project is to enable communities to challenge social norms around gender-based violence and harmful practices and consequently reduce their prevalence.&#x25A3; &#xC774;&#xC9D1;&#xD2B8; &#xB300;&#xC0C1; &#xAD6D;&#xC81C;&#xAE30;&#xAD6C;&#xC640;&#xC758; &#xBA40;&#xD2F0;&#xBC14;&#xC774; &#xC0AC;&#xC5C5; &#xACC4;&#xAE30;, &#xC6B0;&#xB9AC; &#xC778;&#xB825;&#xC758; &#xAD6D;&#xC81C;&#xAE30;&#xAD6C; &#xC9C4;&#xCD9C; &#xAE30;&#xD68C; &#xC81C;&#xACF5;
